* WAIT, PAUSE, NOHALT and CANCEL (OCL-04)
// NOHALT 3
// NOHALT 0,JOB
// NOHALT 2,SESSION
// NOHALT 4,SYSTEM
NOHALT 1,JOB
// WAIT TIME-210000
// WAIT TIME-240000
// WAIT INTERVAL-000130
// WAIT INTERVAL-240000
// WAIT INTERVAL-000000
// WAIT TIME-250000
// WAIT SOON
// LOAD PAYROLL
// FILE NAME-EMPLOY
// RUN
// PAUSE 'Payroll program is complete'
// PAUSE 'It''s time to change the forms'
// PAUSE
// PAUSE Payroll done
// PAUSE 'Printer ?1? is ready'
// IFF DATAF1-FILEA CANCEL
// IF SWITCH1-1 PAUSE 'Check the output, then reply 0'
// CANCEL
// CANCEL PRT,P2
